It's very easy to get started with Channel Manager for uHotelBooking!

1. Installation:
   INSTALL.txt

2. General Info:
   http://hotel-booking-script.com/channel-manager
   http://hotel-booking-script.com/module-channel-manager

3. Live Demo:
	@site https://www.hotel-booking-script.com/live-demo

4. To Remove CSRF validation for some pages in Channel Manager module,
	define at the top of index.php exclusion rules fro CSRF validation,
	Ex.: 
	$CSRF_VALIDATION_EXCLUDE = array('admin' => array('mod_channel_manager_settings'));